    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.08,
    "text": "What if I told you you could heal whatever inflammatory disease that you have and start"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 5.08,
    "end": 6.6,
    "text": "doing it for free?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.6,
    "end": 8.48,
    "text": "Well, it is free."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 8.48,
    "end": 10.68,
    "text": "You can heal any kind of disease that you have for free."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 10.68,
    "end": 12.72,
    "text": "Basically, all you have to do is get your feet grounded."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 12.72,
    "end": 17.08,
    "text": "A body that is consistently grounded cannot sustain chronic inflammation."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 17.08,
    "end": 22.0,
    "text": "It's not the endocural, but it will disrupt the inflammation cycle enough for your body"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 22.0,
    "end": 24.32,
    "text": "to start repairing itself."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 24.32,
    "end": 26.8,
    "text": "You can start healing for free, and it's really simple."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 26.8,
    "end": 27.8,
    "text": "Get your body grounded."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 27.8,
    "end": 30.54,
    "text": "or grounding sheets and if you don't believe me go watch everything in the"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 30.54,
    "end": 34.68,
    "text": "movie and then come back and tell me that I'm wrong. You're welcome."
   }
  ]
